        desc = "AXI_OSTD_PRI0 is priority-based port group command OSTD restriction register 0. AXI_OSTD_PRI0 (offset 0x404 + 0x10 x groups, total reset 0x0000_0000; PROVEN: Hi3516D V300 data sheet, PDF page 287, section 4.1.5.2). Per-instance register (offset = 0x404 + 0x10 x groups); the first instance is modelled.";
